  "notes": {
    "accent": "The accent `--a` is the brand colour a workspace picks (production: config.widget_theme.primary), default Ink #16142B. Light-screen tints derive from it with color-mix() in OKLab. Unlike WebYar, the Respok call stage (`--s1`..`--s3`) is fixed Ink and does not follow a custom accent; Signal #FF5A3C stays for live states, focus and highlights.",
    "onAccent": "`--on-a` is #FFFFFF when white has at least as much WCAG contrast against the accent as Ink #16142B does, otherwise #16142B (reference: lum() / renderVals() in any source/*.dc.html).",
    "radius": "Workspace setting radius sm | md | lg (production config.widget_theme radius) sets the root attribute data-r; md is the default and has no attribute rule.",
    "fonts": "cc.css sets the Respok stack to Figtree only; add \"Vazirmatn\" before the generic families for RTL (brief §6)."
  },
